Package: ampseqQC
Type: Package
Title: Quality Control Reports for Mad4hatter Amplicon Sequencing Runs
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Kathryn", "Murie", email = "kathryn.murie@ucsf.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("EPPIcenter", role = "cph")
    )
Description: Summarises quality control statistics for targeted amplicon
    sequencing runs processed with the Mad4hatter pipeline, combining pipeline
    outputs with a sample manifest. Provides functions to load results, assign
    targets to multiplex PCR reactions from their pools, classify samples as
    pass, repool or reprep, summarise positive and negative controls, filter
    allele tables, and render an HTML QC report.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
